{"id":"1ceb182c9aa75eb2","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange.md","title":"Exchange for Strongly Minimal Closure","display":"thm-strongly-minimal-exchange — Exchange for Strongly Minimal Closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange","aliases":["17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange"],"display":"thm-strongly-minimal-exchange — Exchange for Strongly Minimal Closure","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]","[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-7.2.4b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strongly-minimal-exchange — Exchange for Strongly Minimal Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d88aa28a0fcc379a\" href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" href=\"?note=b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" title=\"17-df-algebraic-closure\">17-df-algebraic-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-7.2.4b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)\">\\(D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d88aa28a0fcc379a\" href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq D\">\\(X\\subseteq D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in D\">\\(a,b\\in D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" href=\"?note=b93c3fbca33bcd2e\" title=\"17-df-algebraic-closure\">17-df-algebraic-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{b\\})\n\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\n\\longrightarrow b\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{a\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{b\\})\n\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\n\\longrightarrow b\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{a\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是固定定义参数基集 C 后的强极小交换律。它依赖所有初等扩张的强极小性，不能从当前结构内的有限/余有限检验自动继承。现代补充，精确书中来源待核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set","status":"resolved","id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-algebraic-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b93c3fbca33bcd2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set","status":"resolved","id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$，$C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$，$D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)$，见 [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-algebraic-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b93c3fbca33bcd2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq D$，$a,b\\in D$；$\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}$ 见 [[17-df-algebraic-closure]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{b\\})\n\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X)\n\\longrightarrow b\\in\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}(X\\cup\\{a\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":1523,"backlinks":[{"id":"a7584f09844a93bb","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$，$C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$，$D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)$，见 [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]。$\\operatorname{acl},\\operatorname{cl},\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Basis}$ 取 [[17-df-algebraic-closure]]；$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ 和 $|X|$ 见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。在 [[17-ax-zfc]] 中工作。交换律见 [[17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange]]。下式先断言基的存在与等势，再定义单值的基数函数 $\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)$；无基参数记号 $\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$ 仅在 $D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)$ 时定义。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embeddin